close_reason: Merge-fence evidence is bounded to the active Git worktree; an enclosing repository's fence never satisfies strict health
contract_change:
  api: "auditMergeAttributeFence (@unbrained/pm-cli/sdk, @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk/merge)"
  before: "The fence audit walked up to eight filesystem parents of the tracker root and accepted the first .gitattributes with a managed block, even one above the Git worktree top level that Git never applies"
  after: "The audit stops at the tracker's Git worktree top level (resolved from the tracker root, or passed as options.gitWorkspaceRoot), so pm health, pm validate and the workspace position read report a linked worktree without its own fence as merge_fence_missing"
  migrate: "No change for a fence at the worktree root or inside the same repository. To keep the old unbounded walk, pass { gitWorkspaceRoot: null }; a strict health check that newly fails needs pm merge install in that worktree"
escape_class: production_defect
